  m_text: "\r\nIn this game, you'll draw your own plant companion that will battle
    alongside you.\r\n\r\n<color=#FF8C42><b>Red</b></color> strokes \u2192 Fire plants
    (high attack)\r\n<color=#4CAF50><b>Green</b></color> strokes \u2192 Grass plants
    (balanced)\r\n<color=#95E1D3><b>Blue</b></color> strokes \u2192 Water plants
    (high HP)\r\n\r\nTry drawing a Sunflower, Cactus, or Water Lily \u2014 each has
    unique abilities.\r\nUse the guidebook (book icon) for drawing tips!\r\nReady
    to create your first plant?"
